      "description": "Cheon Hajin, popularly called as the Iron-Blooded Alliance Leader, wakes up in the body of \u201cByeok Lidan\u201d\u2014the disgrace of his family! His hobby is gambling, and he has been locked in a dark warehouse for a long time. Overnight, Cheon Hajin went from being the greatest expert of Jianghu to the worst possible trash.</p><p>Let's start from the scratch and accomplish everything I could not achieve in my previous life.</p>",
