        "\u0e01\u0e32\u0e23\u0e40\u0e01\u0e34\u0e14\u0e43\u0e2b\u0e21\u0e48\u0e02\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e17\u0e2b\u0e32\u0e23\u0e23\u0e31\u0e1a\u0e08\u0e49\u0e32\u0e07\u0e43\u0e19\u0e2b\u0e21\u0e39\u0e48\u0e02\u0e38\u0e19\u0e19\u0e32\u0e07"
      ],
      "description": "<p>Because of my bloodline, I wasn't able to rise in status and ended up dying as a mere mercenary. However, when I opened my eyes again, they told me I was an archduke's son.</p><p>Now that I finally have family, status, and even talent\u2014things I've only dreamed about before\u2014there's only one thing left to do... climb to the top.</p><p>The outrageous noble life of a former mercenary captain turned archduke's third son begins now.</p>",
