      "description": "<p>A legendary being who wished to sweep the Jianghu in a storm of blood, the Divine Demon, Jeong Cheon.</p><p>At the mere mention of his name, murim trembled in fear, and his sword split the very heavens.</p><p>Even the elite warriors of the Nine Great Sects, none could stand as his equal.</p><p>His martial prowess that shook the world was passed down as a myth, yet in the end, defying all expectations, he met death. For a brief moment, peace returned to the jianghu, and the tale of the Divine Demon seemed buried within legend.</p><p>\u201cBut fate did not let him go.\u201d</p><p>Jeong Cheon, the Divine Demon, returned to life, However, this time, not as the great warrior as he was in his past life, but in the frail body of a fallen noble's heir, a weak young master plagued by madness.</p><p>The soul that once commanded all under heaven is now trapped within a feeble body and endless torment.</p><p>The downfall of his clan, the contempt of those around him, and the creeping shadow of insanity devouring his mind, all of it weighs upon his new life.</p>",
